Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=14}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:56.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The undersea volcano's gonna erupt!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.83,0:01:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are too close to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.51,0:02:04.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go back for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.34,0:02:08.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger! Captain Vander Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ankoro! Wadatsumi! Draw the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:13.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am the richest person in the world,\NCaptain Vander Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:21.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.53,0:02:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Luffy, tell Kraken to get away from here now! - CR}Luffy, tell the kraken\Nto get away from here now!{Z - matching with fmi 02's handling of "the kraken" for now}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:26.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.66,0:02:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't need to!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:34.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's running like hell already!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.91,0:02:37.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That's a terrible look for\Nsuch a mythical monster! - CR}Some mythical monster {\i1}he{\i0} is!{Z - CPS and translationese "that's a terrible look"}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:39.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Nice! Maybe we can hit it off! - CR}Great! I think we'll get along nicely!{Z - Naturalness, and Viz has "That's great! It's got the right idea!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He runs awful. - CR}He's terrible at running!{Z - Naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.21,0:02:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:48.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's how horrifying the eruption is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:50.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{And what is he doing? - CR}And what's he doing?{Z - contraction made for naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.89,0:02:56.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow! Yes! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.36,0:02:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's rehab!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:02.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I wanna see the eruption!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:04.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evacuate to the front of the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.94,0:03:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It doesn't change anything!\NIt's only a few meters! - CR}That won't help at all!\NYou've only gone a few meters!{Z - clarity of addressees and action}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lava's flowing along to the sea floor!{Z - The VA is calling it "maguma." Looks like the terms "magma" and "lava" can get blurred in everyday speech, so just leaving this as "lava" like the OG has}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:31.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The temperature is soaring!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.46,0:03:34.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Feels like I'm in boiling water!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:36.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be cooked!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:36.37,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hot! Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:48.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ghost ship and the sea bonze!{Z - umibozu again, see FI02 for whatever we decide}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:54.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.35,0:03:56.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go faster, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:04:01.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or you're gonna become boiled octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boiled octopus? That's great!\NI wanna eat some!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.17,0:04:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Because of the difference in temperature,\Nthe sea current's starting to swirl! - CR}The different temperatures are\Nmaking the sea current swirl!{Z - CPS}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:15.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Nami - -san, - CR}Nami...{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:18.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{which way is Fishman Island– - CR}Which way is Fishman Island–{Z - lowercase felt odd after a longer pause, but it can go either way}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.21,0:04:21.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:23.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Sanji, you have to focus on your rehab! - CR}Sanji, focus on your rehab!{Z - CPS}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.55,0:04:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1019)}Keep going straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're getting close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jump into that trench!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:44.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:48.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,922)}It's a sheer cliff! You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:51.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's darker than dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Are you sure that Fishman Island is in there?! - CR}Are you sure Fishman Island is down there?!{Z - locational fix}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hot in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's totally dark in the front! Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there'll be another monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:12.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I don't think we can make it home alive! - CR}I don't think we'll make it through this alive!{Z - idiomatic appropriateness}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:13.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The darkness is a bottomless pot\Nthat connects to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron pot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tea caddy! Tea-tea caddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Jump in, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.65,0:05:32.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's erupting again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:36.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right above us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:40.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rocks?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mud?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:43.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an avalanche of rocks and earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:45.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The eruption caused it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:47.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get away, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.07,0:05:52.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go out and cut them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Hold on tightly to my leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.87,0:05:57.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.11,0:05:59.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:01.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:04.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're 8,000 meters deep now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:07.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{If you go out, you'll be\Ncrushed by the water pressure! - CR}The water pressure will\Ncrush you if you go out!{Z - moved things around for better break and to remove passive voice}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:09.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then what should we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:14.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lethal Green Star...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:15.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sargasso!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The sea plant popped out! - CR}A sea plant popped out!{Z - more natural as indefinite}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:25.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's so cool, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:28.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It only holds for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Now is the chance to get away, Surume! - CR}Now's our chance to get away, Surume!{Z - naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, that was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:52.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Yes, it was great judgment! - CR}Yes, that was quick thinking!{Z - stiff translation}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.19,0:06:52.83,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We made it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.03,0:06:59.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surume, you did great too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:00.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're safe now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:02.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.11,0:07:04.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Surume! Hey!\N– Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:06.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Surume!\N– Surume! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Surume! Come on!\N– Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:09.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Surume!\N– Surume! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:10.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Su–\N– Su–
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:40.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.51,0:07:42.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This deep in the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:45.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too bright! My eyes are dazzled!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.45,0:07:48.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I don't have eyes to be dazzled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:54.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.59,0:07:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't see it. It's too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:07:59.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.07,0:08:04.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The needle is pointing at the island! - CR}The needle is pointing at that island!{Z - referent needed establishing}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:05.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:09.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:11.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:14.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's in a big bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.44,0:08:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are clouds?{CR}{Z - alt: "Are those clouds?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.15,0:08:18.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Maybe there is air inside. - CR}Maybe there's air inside.{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.19,0:08:24.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:25.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.76,0:08:29.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a popular site in the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:33.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They made it there! - CR}They made it!{Z - mismatch of "there" in this line and "here" in the next}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:38.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The mermaids dance around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The beautiful mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:42.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The paradise that I've been\Ndreaming of since I was a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hooray! Hooray! Hooray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:46.48,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Super! Super! Super! Super! Super! Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:53.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ♪ Mermaid{o}! Mermaid{o}! ♪\N– ♪ Mermaid{o}! Mermaid{o}! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:55.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ♪ Mermaid{o}! ♪\N– ♪ Mermai– ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:58.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji! You're not ready!\NYou shouldn't even think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:08:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.57,0:09:10.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The rehab didn't work yet! - CR}Your rehab didn't work in time!{Z - clarity, naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't look at real mermaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:17.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:22.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was his dream to see\Nthe mermaids on Fishman Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:24.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he's gonna die if he sees them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.51,0:09:25.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:29.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:33.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Rather than live longer without a dream... - CR}Rather than living on\Nwith my dream unfulfilled...{Viz-ish}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:38.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I wanna die staring at the mermaids\Nin a disgusting way! - CR}I'd rather die while I leer at those mermaids!{Viz-ish}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.86,0:09:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:44.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna look at the mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:45.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The flame of his eroticism! - CR}A flame of eroticism!{Z - CRS}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:50.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.14,0:09:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of meat is in their dishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:56.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Luffy, wipe your drool. - CR}Luffy, wipe off that drool.{Z - naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:58.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you give an order to Surume?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's look for the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.65,0:10:02.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.09,0:10:08.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Why are you obeying such fools as humans, - CR}Why are you taking orders from mere humans,{Viz}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.29,0:10:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kraken?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.60,0:10:16.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The group of sea beasts! - CR}A group of sea beasts!{Z - indefinite needed and updated with "sea beasts" from the glossary}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:21.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're dead! After we got all the way here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:26.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They're so cool! The sea beasts! - CR}Those sea beasts are awesome!{Viz}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody's riding it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1442,27)}What are you doing, Surume?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1442,27)}We were almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{W-We're right in middle of the sea beasts! - CR}Th-The sea beasts are surrounding us!{Z - naturalness and passive voice}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:02.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys are the Straw Hats, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:06.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you all very well.{CR}{Z - alt: <I've/We've heard so much about you.>}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:11.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are the ones who foiled\Nthe plans of the Arlong Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:16.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That act was easy enough to understand. - CR}This would be much simpler\Nif that was all you had done.{Viz - idiomatic clarity}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:22.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{But then you stood up for Hachi-san, the former officer of the Arlong Pirates two years ago... - CR}But two years ago, you stood up for Hachi,\Na former officer of the Arlong Pirates...{Z - naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{and knocked one of the hateful Celestial Dragons out! - CR}and knocked out one of\Nthe hateful Celestial Dragons!{Z - naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.11,0:11:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Just like Fisher Tiger, the hero of\NFishman Island who we respect. - CR}Just like Fisher Tiger,\Nthe respected hero of Fishman Island.{Z - clunky phrasing}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fisher... Tiger...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:42.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's hard to decide what I should do with you.{CR}{Z - alt: "we" instead of "I"}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.79,0:11:45.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Are you guys our enemies or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:51.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{I give you an option. - CR}I'll let you choose.{Z - naturalness}{Z - alt: "I'll" --> "We'll"}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:55.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Do you wanna enlist under our banner, the New Fishman Pirates? - CR}Do you wanna join us,\Nthe New Fishman Pirates?{Z - naturalness and matching "join" used at 13:02}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Or do you refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you refuse, we'll sink you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.37,0:12:02.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What did you say? - CR}What'd you say?{Z - contraction for shorter phrasing}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, fuel up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.71,0:12:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know that Luffy and the others\Nwon't give in to them.{CR}{Z - alt: "give in to them" could be "submit to them"}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:15.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we're 10,000 meters deep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.49,0:12:18.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{We can't even fight,\Nand there's no chance to win. - CR}We can't even fight, much less win.{Z - quick fix on connective tissue due to unintended contradiction}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.09,0:12:26.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Do the Coup de Burst using all the air\Nwe have and charge into Fishman Island! - CR}Use our remaining air for a Coup de Burst\Nand charge into Fishman Island!{Z - naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.73,0:12:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Otherwise, we are all gonna die after coming this far. - CR}Otherwise, we're all gonna die\Nafter coming this far.{Z - contraction}{Z - alt: If we don't, our long voyage will come to an abrupt end.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:37.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems like that's the only way\Nthat we can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll fill it up.{CR}{Z - alt: Okay, I'll fill her up.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:42.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, steer the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:45.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, super count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, do you wanna work\Nunder us, Straw Hat Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:01.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You refused...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the offer to join the New Fishman Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:08.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Then you guys are the fishmen's enemy! - CR}Then you guys are enemies of the fishmen!{Z - naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:11.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just sinful human beings!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:17.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why should we work under you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.41,0:13:20.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Luffy, don't rub them the wrong way! - CR}Luffy, don't provoke them!{Z - idiomatic appropriateness}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.75,0:13:22.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.25,0:13:25.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we can't let you pass through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:28.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is where we sink you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.19,0:13:30.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sea lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:38.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:40.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sink it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:42.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wanna fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:46.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:49.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The {\i1}Sunny{\i0} is a lion too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.88,0:13:53.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's fight someday, sea lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.62,0:13:55.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.09,0:13:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:04.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ship is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:15.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're losing air...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get crushed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.65,0:14:25.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I don't have lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:29.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Endure it! Until we reach Fishman Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:35.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What's wrong with that ship?! - CR}What's going on with that ship?!{Viz}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.03,0:14:38.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're heading in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:40.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, my dear mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The coating came off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.57,0:14:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It got stuck on the giant bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:57.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:14:59.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:03.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,514)}{The bubble here is a double structure! - CR}There are two layers of bubble!{Viz - this will also connect better with the next line, talking about the layers}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:07.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Normal ships will fall in this layer\Nbecause there is only air!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna run into one more bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:12.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.20,0:15:21.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:36.05,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2181,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}{The current is strong! - CR}The current's too strong!{Viz - intent}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:42.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help... me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(1216,0,1,\c&H000000&}Can't breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.56,0:15:49.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,We have four devil fruit eaters but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:15:59.64,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(685,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}Reach...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:02.21,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,...out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.05,0:16:06.68,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami{-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:08.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin{-chan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:11.79,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:14.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2016,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}I can't swim against the current!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That's a crazy way to get in there.\NMaybe they tried to self-destruct. - CR}What a crazy way to get in there.\NMaybe they got themselves killed.{Z/Viz-ish - mistranslation?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:35.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna go after them, Hammond?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know if they're still alive though.{Z - alt: <It's hard to say if they're alive, though.>}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:42.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, we'll go in. - CR}Yeah, we'll go after them.{Z - in answer to 16:32}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.29,0:16:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I don't want the Neptune Army\Nto find them first. - CR}I don't want the Neptune Army\Nfinding them before we do.{Viz - "first" redundancy with next line, and matched with glossary term "the Neptune Army"}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:50.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{But first, let's go back to Noah and let Boss know that... - CR}But first, let's go back\Nto Noah and tell the boss...{Z/Viz - Noah is technically a big ship, but it's serving as part of the district they live in. I don't know that we'd italicize it, just to keep the reveal intact?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.49,0:16:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Straw Hat who shattered Arlong-san's ambition is here. - CR}that Straw Hat, the one who crushed\NArlong's ambitions, is here.{Viz}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:07.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:11.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:12.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:13.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:14.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I looked, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:20.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:21.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:22.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.73,0:17:24.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe he moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:25.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He moved, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he woke up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:34.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.21,0:17:38.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Luffy-chin! - CR}Luffykins!{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:42.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:44.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:50.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Camie! It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You've gotten prettier, Camie-chwan! - CR}You've gotten prettier, Camie my love!{Z - for now, matching with the address he does for Robin since she's also a -chwan}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:58.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We landed on the Fishman Island?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:17:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been told that we were drowning,\Nbut some Mermaids rescued us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:04.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.97,0:18:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, we just woke up\Na couple minutes ago too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:11.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Camie{-chan}'s house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:12.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:14.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is Camie's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.35,0:18:21.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I was gonna pick you guys up,\Nbut I thought it was a month later. - CR}I thought the pickup was a month from now.\NOtherwise, I would've gone to get you guys.{Z - clarity}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.95,0:18:23.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.45,0:18:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:26.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like we got separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.86,0:18:32.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:39.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, I was following them up to some point,\Nbut they were taken somewhere else. - CR}Yeah, I followed them for as long as I could,\Nbut they ended up somewhere else.{Z - clarity and naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:43.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure they'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:44.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.57,0:18:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The bone can't do much in the sea... - CR}The bony one is useless in the water...{Z/Viz - naturalness and presentation}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:50.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{but they got the robot and the green one so they'll be fine! - CR}but the robot and the green one\Nare with him. They'll be just fine.{Z/Viz - naturalness and presentation}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna see the others too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:57.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you're all freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:18:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I made soup, so have some and get warm. - CR}I made some soup to warm you up.{Z - naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:01.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:03.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cold seaweed soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.73,0:19:04.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll love it!{Z - alt: "It's delicious!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.63,0:19:10.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cold soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:17.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't get warm with cold soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.81,0:19:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:23.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I made a mistake!{Z - alt: "I messed up!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:28.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Camie{-chan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:31.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It warms me up anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:33.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:35.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji! I want some too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:39.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your clothes are dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.86,0:19:40.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:42.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They aren't dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.37,0:19:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe they are dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.87,0:19:45.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are dry, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.51,0:19:52.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You dried our clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:53.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:54.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.14,0:19:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.41,0:19:59.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.35,0:20:01.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Medaka Mermaid Quintuplets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:02.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Oneka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.45,0:20:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Twoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.32,0:20:04.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Threeka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:05.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Fourka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.22,0:20:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Fourka Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why can't it be Fiveka?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.09,0:20:11.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They swim fast and they're pretty savvy. - CR}They're fast swimmers and pretty clever.{Z - naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.73,0:20:13.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.93,0:20:16.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{We're at the sea floor of the Mermaid Cove. - CR}We're on the sea floor of Mermaid Cove.{Z - naturalness and naming convention}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:21.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{And this is the girls' dorm for the\NMermaid Cafe, so I have a lot of friends here! - CR}{\q2}Since this is the girls' dorm for the Mermaid Cafe,\Na lot of my friends live here too!{Z/Viz - naturalness}
Comment: 0,0:20:21.10,0:20:22.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.57,0:20:23.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Girls' dorm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:25.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Camie{-chan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.14,0:20:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What... What... What is Mermaid Cafe? - CR}Wh-Wh-What is a Mermaid Cafe?!{Z - formatting}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:32.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's a cafe where I'm working as a waitress. - CR}It's a cafe where I work as a waitress.{Z - naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:34.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{There are a lot of beautiful mermaids! - CR}Many beautiful mermaids work there.{Z/Viz - clarity}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Beautiful mermaids?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.06,0:20:41.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you want a cup of coffee? Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.06,0:20:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sanji is...\N– ...in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:48.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.80,0:20:49.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{– He endured!\N– He endured! - CR}– He endured it!\N– He endured it!{Z - naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:51.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.20,0:20:57.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swore that I'd never have\Na nosebleed and pass out...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.87,0:21:00.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on Fishman Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.55,0:21:08.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I should be rewarded\Nby now, shouldn't I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:10.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How desperate...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:10.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(806.14,906.06,1326.21,1080)}How desperate...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.05,0:21:10.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(931,887.39,1297.7,1080)}How desperate...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.09,0:21:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(1053.89,915.89,1338,1080)}How desperate...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:10.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(1178.74,937.5,1290.81,1080)}How desperate...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:11.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.95,0:21:13.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go up!{CR}{Z - alt: Let's head up there!}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:15.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want you to meet my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.43,0:21:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.90,0:21:23.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It says "Sea Turtle Elevator."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.13,0:21:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Turtle-chin, take us up. - CR}Turtlekins, take us up.{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.58,0:21:35.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a coral apartment in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.14,0:21:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The dorm is at the very bottom\Nso the rent is cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The top floor gets natural light,\Nso it's the most expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.65,0:21:44.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you poor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:46.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{By the way, where are Hachi and Pappagu? - CR}So, where are Hachi and Pappagu?{Z - CRS}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.46,0:21:49.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Ha-chin got severely injured about a year ago. - CR}Hachikins got severely\Ninjured about a year ago.{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He tried to protect the {\i1}Sunny{\i0} at Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.13,0:21:57.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard that he's pretty much recovered now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.77,0:22:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{but Ha-chin is originally from the Fishman District so he's resting there. - CR}but Hachikins is resting up at\Nthe Fishman District where he's from.{Z - attempt at naturalness and -chin}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.91,0:22:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishman District?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.01,0:22:04.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.94,0:22:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's kind of a rough area, but I can take you\Nthere since I feel safe with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.45,0:22:11.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.61,0:22:13.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to thank him face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.78,0:22:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.59,0:22:18.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Pappagu is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.46,0:22:22.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a very famous designer,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.33,0:22:27.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{so he has a big mansion in\NFishverly Hills, the high-class district. - CR}so he has a huge mansion in\Na rich area called Fishverly Hills.{Viz}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.53,0:22:31.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna deliver clams there\Ntoday so come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.37,0:22:32.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's your pet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.57,0:22:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you live with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.44,0:22:39.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That area is way beyond my means.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.01,0:22:42.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have better clams here, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:44.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.05,0:22:48.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Hey, that's that straw-like thing? - CR}Hey, what's that\Ndrinking-straw-like things?{Z - naturalness, he's talking about something like a drinking straw, but Viz went with "tube," so we can decide what to use later; I imagine it's supposed to be like those twisty fun straws}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:49.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.35,0:22:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the water road that a bubble craftsman made.{CR}{Z - alt: "a bubble craftsman" --> "bubble artisans" like what Viz has}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.06,0:22:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{We and the fish get in and... - CR}Both we and the fish can\Ntravel through them, and...{Z - naturalness and a bit of inspo from Viz}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.59,0:22:59.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.27,0:23:08.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're here, on the surface!{CR}{Z - alt: "We made it! We surfaced!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.27,0:23:10.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Luffy-chin! - CR}Luffykins!{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.84,0:23:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.54,0:23:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can even swim in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.88,0:23:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, looks fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.08,0:23:20.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.48,0:23:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides that, there's a sky\Nand clouds in the deep sea!{CR}{Z - alt: Forget that! There's a sky\Nand clouds in the deep sea!}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.29,0:23:26.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.09,0:23:27.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's a girl's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:30.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.56,0:23:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Are your friends fine now?\NThe pirates who were drowning. - CR}Are your pirate friends okay now?\NThey were drowning after all.{Z/Viz - naturalness}
Comment: 0,0:23:32.56,0:23:34.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are your friends fine now?
Comment: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pirates who were drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.00,0:23:42.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys didn't come in by the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.21,0:23:46.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys don't look that scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.44,0:23:49.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys entered illegally?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.95,0:23:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I love pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.83,0:24:05.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like a living fairy tale!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.59,0:24:09.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A land of coral! The Mermaid Cove!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.51,0:24:24.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.38,0:24:26.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji is crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.85,0:24:29.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's crying harder than\Nwhen he left the Baratie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.39,0:24:34.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.26,0:24:38.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my All Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.86,0:24:43.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1320,1053)}{Is it really what you want, Sanji? - CR}Is that what you really want, Sanji?{Z - naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.70,0:24:46.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce them to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.04,0:24:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He's the captain, Luffy-chin. - CR}He's the captain, Luffykins.{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.54,0:24:50.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, good to see you! - CR}Yeah, nice to meet you!{Z - response appropriateness}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.37,0:24:53.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The crying one is Sanji-chin. - CR}The crying one is Sanjikins.{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.84,0:24:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The one with the nose - Usopp-chin. - CR}The one with the nose is Usoppkins.{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.71,0:24:56.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Nice to meet you! - CR}Hey there!{Z - CPS}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.95,0:24:59.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The racoon is Chopper-chin. - CR}The tanuki is Chopperkins.{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.12,0:25:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.15,0:25:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.32,0:25:06.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.69,0:25:08.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's dance in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.76,0:25:16.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.40,0:25:19.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is too good to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.00,0:25:21.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm probably gonna die today!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:23.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How negative!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:26.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Seriously, what happened to you\Nin the past two years? - CR}Seriously, what happened\Nto you these past two years?!{Z - naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.78,0:25:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the paradise\Nthat you've been dreaming of!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.35,0:25:33.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're so funny, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.58,0:25:35.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– No, he's not trying to be funny!\N– No, he's not trying to be funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.83,0:25:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.59,0:25:50.53,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Straw Hat Luffy finally got this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.60,0:25:52.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.60,0:25:56.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What should we do, Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.77,0:26:00.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring him...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.78,0:26:03.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,here!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=15}===============================DIALOGUE============================
